 codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/db6008997fd5666215894bb49eaf03f5.mp4?t=1768311029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chrono Shard is currently in &quot;early stages&quot; of development, you can follow it's development on the Orangepixel Youtube channel, where I frequently post update videos and, hop on the Discord where I frequently ask for feedback and show early new features!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/46d2ab5ddafc5db6ee47d8da683fd80d.poster.avif?t=1768311029\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/46d2ab5ddafc5db6ee47d8da683fd80d.webm?t=1768311029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/46d2ab5ddafc5db6ee47d8da683fd80d.mp4?t=1768311029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Orangepixel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/ef452e3f23b12e4031c89bc56749a4b72814d281/header.jpg?t=1768311029","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright (c) OrangePixel","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 ghz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD3000 or higher with OpenGL 2.1 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sou